				<p class="text-[0.7rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-accent mb-4">Engineering Leader · E-Commerce · Builder of Great Teams</p>

				<h1 class="text-[clamp(3.5rem,10vw,6rem)] font-black uppercase leading-[0.9] tracking-[-0.02em] mb-8">
