				<p class="italic text-xl leading-relaxed text-[#ccc] mb-8 max-w-[28rem]">
					16 years. One company. <strong class="not-italic text-white">Endless challenges embraced.</strong><br />
					Now ready to bring that same energy somewhere new.
				</p>

				<a href="mailto:richard.gill1986@gmail.com" class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 bg-accent text-white no-underline text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.15em] px-8 py-4 hover:bg-accent-hover transition-colors">→ Embrace the Challenge</a>
