				<div class="text-center">
					<span class="text-[2.5rem] font-black text-white leading-none block">16</span>
					<span class="text-[0.6rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-white/70 block mt-[0.4rem]">Years in the game</span>
