						<div class="border-l-[3px] border-accent pl-4">
							<h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white mb-1">The calm in the storm</h3>
							<p class="text-[0.9rem] text-[#aaa] leading-[1.6]">Migrations, deadlines, audits. Richard is the person teams want in the room when things get complicated.</p>
						</div>
					</div>
					<p class="mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-[#222] italic text-[0.9rem] text-[#666] text-center">No relish on this CV. No filler, no padding, no mystery meat. Just the good stuff, delivered hot. ★</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>

		<!-- CAREER -->
		<div class="bg-dark-section border-t border-[#333]">
			<div class="max-w-[52rem] mx-auto px-8 py-16">
				<div class="flex items-baseline gap-4 mb-10 pb-4 border-b border-[#444]">
