					<span class="inline-block bg-accent text-white text-[0.6rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] px-[0.6rem] py-[0.2rem] mb-2">Current</span>
					<h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-1 leading-tight">Head of Engineering</h3>
					<p class="italic text-[0.9rem] text-[#888] mb-4">Leading the team behind one of the world's biggest sports nutrition brands.</p>
					<ul class="list-none p-0 m-0 flex flex-col gap-2">
						<li class="flex gap-3 text-[0.9rem] text-[#ccc] leading-normal"><span class="text-accent shrink-0 font-bold">—</span>Managing 4 developers and 2 UX designers, keeping Myprotein.com sharp, fast and converting.</li>
