						<li class="flex gap-3 text-[0.9rem] text-[#ccc] leading-normal"><span class="text-accent shrink-0 font-bold">—</span>Migrated <strong>UK, Germany and Japan</strong> (the top 3 revenue locales) with zero downtime.</li>
						<li class="flex gap-3 text-[0.9rem] text-[#ccc] leading-normal"><span class="text-accent shrink-0 font-bold">—</span>Shipped all <strong>64 Nutrition sites</strong> onto a new platform in Q1 2025.</li>
						<li class="flex gap-3 text-[0.9rem] text-[#ccc] leading-normal"><span class="text-accent shrink-0 font-bold">—</span>Collaborated with PwC on a 6-week design sprint for new MP.com templates. On time, every time.</li>
						<li class="flex gap-3 text-[0.9rem] text-[#ccc] leading-normal"><span class="text-accent shrink-0 font-bold">—</span>Partnered with CRO and UX on Core Web Vitals improvements across the estate.</li>
					</ul>
				</div>

