					<ul class="list-none p-0 m-0 flex flex-col gap-2">
						<li class="flex gap-3 text-[0.9rem] text-[#ccc] leading-normal"><span class="text-accent shrink-0 font-bold">—</span><strong>81 websites delivered in 2021</strong> alone, part of a wider two-squad output of 134.</li>
						<li class="flex gap-3 text-[0.9rem] text-[#ccc] leading-normal"><span class="text-accent shrink-0 font-bold">—</span>Used Jira data to identify sprint efficiency gaps and coach engineers individually.</li>
						<li class="flex gap-3 text-[0.9rem] text-[#ccc] leading-normal"><span class="text-accent shrink-0 font-bold">—</span>Recruited and onboarded <strong>6 new team members</strong> fully remotely.</li>
